{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-lev-26-1","title":"Leviticus 26:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LEV","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Of idolatry. 2 Religiousness. 3 A blessing to them that keep the commandments. 14 A curse to those that break them. 40 God promises to remember them that repent.</p>\n<p>Ye shall. 19:4; Ex 20:4,5,23; 23:24; 34:17; De 4:16-19; 5:8,9; 16:21,22; 27:15 Ps 97:7; 115:4-8; Isa 2:20; 44:9-20; 48:5-8; Jer 10:3-8; Ac 17:29 Ro 2:22,23; 1Co 10:19,20; Re 13:14,15; 22:15 standing image. or, pillar. image of stone. or, figuredstone. Heb. a stone of picture.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lev-26-2","title":"Leviticus 26:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LEV","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>19:30</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lev-26-3","title":"Leviticus 26:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LEV","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>18:4,5; De 11:13-15; 28:1-14; Jos 23:14,15; Jud 2:1,2; Ps 81:12-16 Isa 1:19; 48:18,19; Mt 7:24,25; Ro 2:7-10; Re 22:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lev-26-4","title":"Leviticus 26:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LEV","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Then I. De 28:12; 1Ki 17:1; Job 5:10; 37:11-13; 38:25-28; Ps 65:9-13; 68:9 Ps 104:13; Isa 5:6; 30:23; Jer 14:22; Eze 34:26,27; Joe 2:23,24 Am 4:7,8; Mt 5:45; Ac 14:17; Jas 5:7,17,18; Re 11:6 the land. 25:21; Ps 67:6; 85:12; Eze 34:27; 36:30; Hag 2:18,19; Zec 8:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lev-26-5","title":"Leviticus 26:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LEV","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>threshing. Am 9:13; Mt 9:37,38; Joh 4:35,36 eat your. 25:19; Ex 16:8; De 11:15; Joe 2:19,26; Ac 14:17; 1Ti 6:17 dwell. 25:18; Job 11:18,19; Ps 46:1-7; 90:1; 91:1-14; Pr 1:33; 18:10 Jer 23:6; Eze 34:25-28; Mt 23:37; 1Pe 1:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lev-26-6","title":"Leviticus 26:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LEV","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>I will. 1Ch 22:9; Ps 29:11; 147:14; Isa 9:7; 45:7; Jer 30:10; Ho 2:18 Mic 4:4; Hag 2:9; Zec 9:10; Joh 14:27; Ro 5:1; Php 4:7-9 ye shall. Job 11:19; Ps 3:5; 4:8; 127:1,2; Pr 3:24; 6:22; Isa 35:9; Jer 30:10 Jer 31:26; Eze 34:25; Zep 3:13; Ac 12:6 rid. Heb. cause to cease. Ex 23:29; 2Ki 2:24; 17:25,26; Job 5:23; Isa 35:9; Eze 5:17 Eze 14:15,21 shall the sword. Eze 14:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lev-26-8","title":"Leviticus 26:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LEV","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Nu 14:9; De 28:7; 32:30; Jos 23:10; Jud 7:19-21; 1Sa 14:6-16 1Sa 17:45-52; 1Ch 11:11,20; Ps 81:14,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lev-26-9","title":"Leviticus 26:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LEV","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>for I. Ex 2:25; 2Ki 13:23; Ne 2:20; Ps 89:3; 138:6,7; Jer 33:3; Heb 8:9 make you. Ge 17:6,7,20; 26:4; 28:3,14; Ex 1:7; De 28:4,11; Ne 9:23; Ps 107:38 establish. Ge 6:18; 17:7; Ex 6:4; Isa 55:3; Eze 16:62; Lu 1:72</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lev-26-10","title":"Leviticus 26:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LEV","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>25:22; Jos 5:11; 2Ki 19:29; Lu 12:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lev-26-11","title":"Leviticus 26:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LEV","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>I will. Ex 25:8; 29:45; Jos 22:19; 1Ki 8:13,27; Ps 76:2; 78:68,69 Ps 132:13,14; Eze 37:26-28; Eph 2:22; Re 21:3 abhor. 20:23; De 32:19; Ps 78:59; 106:40; Jer 14:21; La 2:7; Zec 11:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lev-26-12","title":"Leviticus 26:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LEV","chapterStart":26,"verseStart